 h mainstream heat.\nHer offbeat perspective has been featured on "Don't Tel
 l Comedy”\, “America’s Got Talent” and\n“American Idol” (yes\, 
 really). Janet has opened for Maria Bamford\, Gary Gulman\, Jessica\nKirson
 \, and Eugene Mirman\, and has performed at festivals including the Women i
 n Comedy\nFestival\, Asheville Comedy Festival\, Rogue Island Comedy Festiv
 al\, Boston Comedy Festival\,\nBig Sky Comedy Festival\, and Hampton Beach 
 Comedy Festival.\nHer debut comedy album\, Not Smart Enough\, is available 
